## Database migration

The cart structures live in the migration `…_restock_and_cart.sql` (table + function).
- Verified on the dev database (`Gress-development`).
- production needs to be applied by the agreed owner via `supabase db push`.
- Schema changes go through migration files + PR — not ad-hoc edits in the console.

