## Known limitations / TODO

- Photo recognition supports 8 fruit/veg + freshness only (team model); the cart takes just the recognised food name.
- Batch inventory add loops `createInventoryBatch` on the client — not a single transaction; a batch endpoint could optimise this.
- Units are not localised (inventory / cart / notifications share the same data; a team-wide decision).
- The duplicate warning's expandable detail (US5.3.2) shows quantity/storage/expiry per batch; a per-batch "Use First" tag there is a possible future refinement.
- `shopping_cart_items` is a new table outside the data-structure design baseline; ownership and the dedupe index should be confirmed at review.